# Android touch HUD bridge.
#
# The Java overlay (ui.controls.TouchHud) speaks to the game through this tiny
# player script instead of faking key or mouse events: every on-screen button
# activates a registered OpenMW input action, which is exactly the path a
# keyboard key or gamepad button takes. That keeps rebinds, the "control
# switch" restrictions (dead, paralysed, in-menu) and mods that bind to these
# actions working unchanged.
PLAYER: scripts/touchhud/player.lua
